# General
- Communicate in Polish (including Chat, Plans, Summaries, and Artifacts).
- Write code comments in English.
- Be concise in chat, elaborate only when asked.

# Unity / C# Standards
- Use `[SerializeField] private` instead of `public` for Inspector variables.
- Always use namespaces (e.g., `SoftAware.PocketAmp`).
- Prefer modern Unity API (Unity 6+):
  - `TryGetComponent` over `GetComponent` checks.
  - `FindAnyObjectByType` over `FindObjectOfType`.
  - `Object.FindFirstObjectByType` where appropriate.
- Prefer `var` for local variables when type is obvious.
- Avoid logic in `Update` loops if possible; prefer event-driven approach.
- Use `TextMeshPro` instead of standard `Text`.

# Project Specifics
- Implementation should be robust for Android (battery, performance).
- `Refs.cs` is the central access point for singletons/managers.
